  "prefLabel": "Gcd 403.02 Issuance of Tag and Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 403.02 Issuance of Tag and Certificate. The commission shall issue a registration tag and a certificate to the owner of a service animal after verification of the dog’s permanent registration and licensing with the town.\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #12869, eff 9-20-19; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
